        <mxCell id="c123" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined in coral: the Plant row, the available, practical and routing hours of the five centers added, and the two shares of the plant. Outlined in teal: the lines of the last CTE that build it, a UNION ALL of one row that sums the centers (its WorkCenterID is NULL). The editor is scrolled to the last CTE and the final SELECT, and the grid one column to the right: WorkCenterID, the first column, is out of view. The CTEs above sum the completions, the routings and the calendar.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="838" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
